    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d5">

                <pb facs="0107" n="5" sameAs="frus:frus1943/pg5"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Hopkins Papers: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Prime Minister Churchill to the President’s Special Assistant</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Hopkins</hi>)<anchor
                        n="1" xml:id="d5-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-03-20">March 20, 1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>From Prime Minister to Mister Harry Hopkins personal and most secret.</p>
                <p>I am hoping to receive a reply to my telegram to you of February 27 about 
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tube Alloys</hi>. Time is passing and
                    collaboration appears to be at a standstill. We have made some progress in the
                    last three months.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Prime</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d5-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d5-f1-content">
                <p>Manner of transmission not indicated, but presumably via military channels.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
